{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FFQotA1OrwtZnz92IwcDbA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:31.905696+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FFQotA1OrwtZnz92IwcDbA","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/fT1MwSzsYeIWxN1gchhDuoMcHgv0qDicicRbxwiagtl6cVAZvkHicwRMyD0xUl58ucQELSvTzv9oIr5Ka4ODpvj5fV5iaFvvWgc21jmfr9P7JDkk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为增进大学生对兰州大学护理学院的了解，搭建高校间大学生的交流平台，帮助大学生了解护理学科发展前沿，特举办“护理学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动，现将相关事项通知如下：</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动简介</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeJNOkGyzcTibMFeibckcxdcp5hU1bIKqF3xghoNCKcfJEicV9gZgiaW6icwEzrYtNJSC2hNKfbmewokrDXr0qydBbZnY29ib8rtH9TzQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.活动时间：</span><strong><span>2026年7月5—7日</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.活动名额：</span><strong><span>20人</span></strong><span>左右。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请条件</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeJJFJocf9lcr0n1TkKYbDMarO0cDlia1C7CEHk4DYEoqrV6gCZXnlZckp89T6eGsFBla3uC12fxaLibVlWPp45wFlYW8GFuMg74c/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德智体美劳全面发展，身心健康，无学术不端行为及违法违纪行为；</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优秀，本科阶段总成绩排名原则上在所读学校同年级本专业</span><strong><span>前30%</span></strong><span>，英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>3.具备良好的专业理论基础和科研潜力；</span></p><p><span>4.2026届护理学全日制应届本科毕业生。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资料</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeLXaleGMic415FZW2gUctTzuia9kC6O2GWWppT8T4WOGsDHNicp7gb6Owiay8uYUG3HicsXL0KtzNcVCTgwvq7iamjcVW116KT1iaP8ok/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.身份证、学生证扫描件和复印件；</span></p><p><span>2.本科前5个学期（四年制本科）或7个学期（五年制本科）成绩单（由教务部门或院系盖章）、排名专业前30％的证明（由教务部门或院系盖章）扫描件和原件；</span></p><p><span>3.大学英语四、六级成绩单或其他英语水平证明（如近两年内TOEFL成绩或近三年内GRE成绩等）扫描件；</span></p><p><span>4.其他证明材料扫描件（如体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文或其他原创性工作成果、获奖证书等）。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请流程</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeLJP6K8evN8XwNBF2wgeuZ8UdbY7o1VPh9WSNyqYWZTk8fyDglmTk7AXQiaNtuXnj1ULX1C4cR7OOdl18ZlZZ9ia05ia22XJG8pMs/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>01</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名及电子材料提交</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>即日起至</span><strong><span>2026年6月28日</span></strong><span>，扫描下方二维码进行网上报名，请将申请材料电子版按顺序合并为一个PDF文档，以“暑期夏令营+毕业学校+姓名”命名上传。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fT1MwSzsYeJJXgKxiaM3LVQMLOHb5ibeO41owZaU8Pu8WibMJgsjzMmIj9HBUKPFDblSlLjEmfIAg9wNK7MxwFptxAjRJd1kM4RE97XUXTDoBQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>02</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报到及纸质材料提交</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请人通过营员资格审核后，入营报到时携带身份证、学生证原件，提交身份证和学生证复印件、兰州大学护理学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表原件（见附件）、成绩单原件。</span></p><p><span>注：网上信息填报、电子材料、纸质材料提交缺一不可。材料须真实有效，因信息填写错误、填报虚假信息造成的后果由申请人本人承担。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeItETTQgpgJiaOUgxnxJHEc0c9icmeavnPIFWNIz0rPibKKoTiarTzCWIm1cIGA8TtKouJo6W28G0ibNJDy1jgT4gm4LBd88ficHsicmg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/fT1MwSzsYeKt2xDZraicJZIPgR4H5HaVt4ibV6KNbtK3xUWthhiaPia9pfvF1U3kasUFrAOv6MVZVLhQLEeIbDw8eib1h0Bx3AFKGG9ebmPwyf5Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>资格审查与营员考核</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeJ7BIeJ4AbzQVqTM9DzA75TF3Y3h3stUFojgpl59sgkibVhjvhibNhhopqcZY3p3mAoyhOCAtMMibrQdIAxNEhR3Fx4u3I53M97wg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.学院将组织专人逐一审核申请者提供的各项材料，最终参营名单</span><strong><span>6月30日前</span></strong><span>在学院网站（http://nursing.lzu.edu.cn/）上公布。参加学员请实名加入夏令营</span><strong><span>QQ群938569960</span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>2.学院将通过灵活方式考核营员在夏令营期间的综合能力和科研潜力表现，根据考核情况，确定优秀营员名单，颁发优秀营员证书。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>其他</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeLCmSGIIFVtBqg9QJXYumBtx2kS6KicABlFIJvoFeONopDwXRrRESibgFRrw09CCFjP5lyvxkTESoVrOy1VevkOxRjWj0yHBpsTc/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.夏令营期间兰州大学护理学院将为营员提供住宿（包含2晚，双人标间，原则上要求双人入住，本地学校学生不提供住宿）、购买人身保险、报销异地学校学生往返交通费（火车硬座、硬卧，高铁二等座，汽车）。请自行提前预订往返车票，主办方不提供订票服务。</span></p><p><span>2.营员必须遵守兰州大学有关规章制度和夏令营的纪律要求，服从工作人员安排，并按时参加夏令营期间的各项活动，营员活动期间的个人安全由本人负责。</span></p><p><span>3.本通知未尽事宜，由兰州大学护理学院负责解释。</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeKFqrgwZrUvnkaib7dUl5u4MicZSSDr5tA8xmZhj26ak2yic3hzke0yExZHE21JXvvp04IqcwJDUE23xOlOe8EMq4um2iaVibXP3zpM/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>联系部门：兰州大学护理学院办公室</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0931-8511631</span></p><p><span>联系人：许老师</span></p><p><span>邮箱：xygjy@lzu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>地址：甘肃省兰州市城关区雁西路28号兰州大学护理学院</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FFQotA1OrwtZnz92IwcDbA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件：兰州大学护理学院2026年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表</a></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/fT1MwSzsYeKibl5NyZz5ad6BwUJtkhTNTXibNCciav8rOALOItqFDUicPYOKJR6ozEdzWmibnvyXgf0WcY4piaibOGoEsEXtibk0pgBdM03iaFYp0NWE/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/fT1MwSzsYeKh3B5iaSfFPzdBp89KsLIGMccNicL9gq9Q3k0nM41aVz1xbUoBnr13vNrtZeX03OF9uQkBAxnoiaes1d6BNpw4Mg63n7ToZjvJuo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>微信公众号 | lzuhuli</span></span></p><p><span><span>图文来源 | </span><span><span>护理学院</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>执行编辑 | 张心冉</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核 | 陈可 钟可</span></span></p><p><span><spa